34. AUTOMATED DRAWING QUALITY CONTROL
Before a document package becomes available for final acceptance, OneDraft should execute automated checks.
Checks include:
Missing Dimensions
Unresolved References
Duplicate Tags
Missing Sheet References
Broken Section References
Missing Room Tags
Missing Door/Window Tags
Drawing Scale
Title Block
Revision Consistency
Sheet Number Consistency
Model/Drawing Mismatch
Unresolved Redlines
Validation Failures
The result becomes a Document QA Report.

