38. JOB QUEUE
Long-running computational tasks shall operate asynchronously.
Examples:
Generate Building Model
Generate 100+ Drawing Sheets
Render High-Resolution Images
Run Full Code Validation
Generate Document Package
Rebuild Affected Views
These operations enter a job queue.
The interface can display:
QUEUED
→ PROCESSING
→ VALIDATING
→ COMPLETED
or:
FAILED
with a diagnostic record.

39. COMPUTATIONAL WORKERS
Worker services execute queued operations.
Potential worker classes:
AI Worker
Geometry Worker
Validation Worker
Rendering Worker
Document Worker
Code Worker
Workers should be horizontally scalable.
A large commercial project may require substantially more computational resources than a small residential project.

