51. ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE
OneDraft is consequently not architected as:
ChatGPT + CAD
It is architected as:
A persistent architectural project system with Aria functioning as its intelligent reasoning and orchestration layer.
The AI becomes the interface through which the customer can communicate with the project model.
The project model becomes the persistent source of truth.
The geometry engine becomes the computational drafting mechanism.
The regulatory engine becomes the jurisdictional control mechanism.
The validation engine becomes the consistency mechanism.
The documentation engine becomes the professional drawing-production mechanism.
The revision system becomes the collaborative mechanism.
And the provenance layer becomes the historical record of how the final project was produced.
